cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If AgentTwin helped your work, cite the repository."
title: "AgentTwin: frozen-replay testing for LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  AgentTwin records one LLM-agent run into a JSONL tape and replays it offline,
  with no model call and no side effects, so a failing run becomes a regression
  test that can be committed and asserted on in CI.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AgentTwin contributors"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ravenkernel/agenttwin"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/agenttwin/"
keywords:
  - llm
  - agents
  - testing
  - replay
  - determinism
  - ci
